{"text": "The rabbit hole went straight on like a tunnel for some way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then it dipped suddenly, and Alice found herself falling down a very deep well. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Either the well was very deep, or she fell very slowly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She had plenty of time to look around and to wonder what would happen next. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The sides of the well were filled with cupboards and bookshelves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As she passed, she took down a jar from one of the shelves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It had a label that said ORANGE MARMALADE, but it was empty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She did not want to drop it, because it might hit someone below. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So she put it into a cupboard as she fell past it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After a fall like this, falling downstairs will be nothing, thought Alice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She wondered if she was getting near the center of the earth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She also said grand words like Latitude and Longitude, which she did not understand at all.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "r", "a", "b", "b", "i", "t", " ", "h", "o", "l", "e", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "s", "t", "r", "a", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "t", "u", "n", "n", "e", "l", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", " ", "w", "a", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "i", "t", " ", "d", "i", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "s", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "A", "l", "i", "c", "e", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", "s", "e", "l", "f", " ", "f", "a", "l", "l", "i", "n", "g", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "a", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "d", "e", "e", "p", " ", "w", "e", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".